; Stone Islet (ow_7_3): reeds on a small islet in the lake. The reed cluster at the east rim hides the
; reed grotto pocket ow_7_3#grotto (hook cut). Mooring posts serve raft edges e046, e059 and e061.

room ow_7_3
terrain Stone Islet: islet, reeds, pond
floor_color 0.18 0.22 0.17
grid
#########..#########
#..e...e.......wwww#
#.....e.....e..wwww#
#..................#
....e.........e....#
..............wwwww#
#............wwwwww#
#.wwwww......wwwwww#
#.wwwwwee.....www..#
#########..#########
enemy fen_leech 8,6
opener cut_screen 12,4 look=reed_cluster
door ow_7_3#grotto Inside 12,4
spawn FromPocket 11,4
spawn Default 3,2
; Deep water seals each raft exit; the edge id pairs the shore posts.
water @960,48 size=192,96
mooring @960,144 id=e046 target_room=ow_7_2 target_mooring=e046 landing_offset=0,56
water @48,480 size=96,192
mooring @144,480 id=e059 target_room=ow_6_3 target_mooring=e059 landing_offset=56,0
water @960,912 size=192,96
mooring @960,816 id=e061 target_room=ow_7_4 target_mooring=e061 landing_offset=0,-56
; Walkable marsh water contains each fen leech.
shallows 8,6 size=192,192
